					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Implement only the user-authorized change described by Barry's task. Inspect the source before changing it. Prefer a small correction to another abstraction. Apply the Catalyst naming standard to every changed class, method, variable and argument. Keep GT/Pharo integrations separate from GemStone-compatible runtime contracts."
			},
