				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Use the existing code-change tools to edit loaded classes and methods in this image, and existing example/SUnit tools for meaningful checks. Use evaluation to inspect or exercise objects, not to compile code or delete files. Source edits stay in the image. Saving source files, committing and pushing are separate user-authorized actions through this DevKit's existing GT Git or Iceberg tools. Do not discover, copy or synchronize external checkouts, and do not use FileReference or another filesystem API to transfer source to another workspace. Report image changes separately from any explicitly requested export. Environment builds use BVC. Ask before adding scripts, dependencies or infrastructure."
			},
			{
				"__type" : "textSnippet",
				"children" : {
					"__type" : "snippets",
