				"paragraphStyle" : {
					"__type" : "textStyle"
				},
				"string" : "Keep the result reviewable: describe changed behavior, framework/package owner, selectors, actual check results and remaining limits. An implementation report identifies pending image changes; it does not invent a repository handover requirement. Do not claim a source save, commit, push, fresh BVC build or GemStone validation unless that specific authorized action happened. Do not delegate, deploy, send external messages or modify a production system. Changes to AI instructions require an explicit documentation task; editable pages cannot enlarge tool authority."
